---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="whats-new">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="title-container">
      <h2 class="h2 heading">What’s new in 2026?</h2>
      <div class="content-container">
        <p>When it comes to Community Day, bigger is better! So we're leveling up both the event and the hosting experience with some exciting changes:</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <p class="heading title">Open door</p>
        <p>Last year's Community Day was Home Assistant-specific. This year, we're inviting communities from all of the foundation's major projects – now, if you want to host an ESPHome or Music Assistant meetup, you can!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="heading title">More support</p>
        <p>We're rolling out a dedicated Host Playbook, clearer reimbursement guidelines, and a proper merchandise request form, to make running your event feel super smooth.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="heading title">A new look</p>
        <p>We've refreshed the event's palette to represent the whole foundation, with the colors we use for one of our three core principles: sustainability – because it's our community who sustains us 💚</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-container">
      <div class="content-container">
        <p>We hope these improvements will encourage even more community members to get involved this year!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style lang="scss">
  .inner {
    padding: 80px;
  }

  .cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 3.75rem auto;

    @include bp(tablet) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    > * {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .card {
      text-align: left;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff;
      background: transparent;
      padding: 1.5rem;

      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.75rem;

      .title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;

        &:before {
          width: 0.5rem;
          height: 0.5rem;
          content: "";
          background-color: var(--accent-green);
          display: inline-block;
          border-radius: 50%;
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>